 ditioning walk ONLY (this is THE eccentric day - keep it focused\, no up
 per) - WED easy run + strides + push - THU vertical + pull - FRI REST - 
 SAT LONG DAY. Eccentric work sits 48 h apart throughout: Tue heavy\, Thu
  moderate\, Sat long. That spacing is the constraint - force loss needs 
 3 days to recover and soreness 4\, so 24 h between eccentric sessions co
 mpounds damage instead of building tolerance. Cutbacks weeks 10 and 13. 
 CUT ORDER: (1) Sunday ride\, (2) Thursday vertical. Never Saturday's lon
 g day or Tuesday's legs. HYROX SEEDING STARTS: only via substitution ins
 ide Thursday's pull session - erg warm-up\, farmers carry\, dead hangs. 
 NOT wall balls\, sandbag lunges or burpee broad jumps - those are all qu
 ad and eccentric load competing directly with the descent block. NOT com
 promised running - it breaks the 80/20 distribution Madeira needs. The p
 oint is to arrive in November with technique and grip already built\, so
  the first two Hyrox weeks are productive instead of remedial.\n74 days 
 to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
