SUMMARY:▼ KIT REHEARSAL: load the vest to ~2.6 kg with…
DESCRIPTION:KIT REHEARSAL: load the vest to ~2.6 kg with full race carboh
 ydrate (~13 gels plus pre-measured mix) and walk 60 min. Checkpoints are
  WATER ONLY - you carry every calorie across three ~2h10 legs. Drink mix
  must stay 6-8%: a 500 ml flask holding 80 g is 16%\, and 42% of a 10% d
 rink is still in the stomach an hour later.\n\nWeek 9 of 17 - Build\nGUT
  TRAINING STARTS. Target 60-80 g carb/h by week 14\, from 40-50 now\, +1
 0 g every two weeks. No drop bags and no crew at Madeira - only ~2 check
 points\, ~10 km apart - so you carry 400-500 g of carbohydrate yourself.
  Rehearse the weight and the stowage\, not just the products. INTENSITY 
 STARTS THIS WEEK. Thursday's vertical becomes intervals - the plan had n
 o hard sessions at all through weeks 7-8\, which was a gap. Target distr
 ibution is 80-85% easy\, 15-20% hard\, with the hard work on incline.\n6
 3 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
