DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260906
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260907
SUMMARY:○ OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min - Sunday is now a REST day by de
 fault. Take the ride only if you feel good and Monday's run is easy. Wit
 h a quality session on Monday you need this rest more than you need the 
 ride.\n\nWeek 10 of 17 - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.
 \nCutback. Deliberate\, and the reason matters: in trail runners\, injur
 y weeks were preceded by load DROPPING 16-24% then rebounding 15-37%. Yo
 -yo loading\, not absolute load\, is what precedes injury. This dip is p
 lanned and the rebound is controlled.\n56 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
