 . ~11 x 15 floors\, about 495 m. Lift up\, WALK DOWN - the descent is th
 e point. Dutch stair pitch is 30-33 deg\, inside the optimal climbing ra
 nge\, and Madeira is full of stone staircases. Zero travel\, weather-pro
 of.\n\nWeek 10 of 17 - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.\n
 Cutback. Deliberate\, and the reason matters: in trail runners\, injury 
 weeks were preceded by load DROPPING 16-24% then rebounding 15-37%. Yo-y
