UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w10-s7-benchmark@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T215856Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260907
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260908
SUMMARY:5 KM TIME TRIAL (5 km)
DESCRIPTION:5 KM TIME TRIAL - the number the whole plan has been missing.
  Warm up 10-15 min easy + 4-6 x 20 s strides + 3-4 min rest. Then 5 km f
 lat\, hard as you can SUSTAIN. Go out at 5:15/km and hold\; check in at 
 2 km\; kick from 4 km. Do NOT start at 4:40 - a blown TT gives an unusab
 le number. Flat\, no lights\, no turns: Vondelpark outer loop or the Ams
 tel. Auto-lap every 1 km. Down week\, Sunday rest behind you - no better
  day exists.\n\nWeek 10 of 17 - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add 
 volume.\nCutback. Deliberate\, and the reason matters: in trail runners\
 , injury weeks were preceded by load DROPPING 16-24% then rebounding 15-
 37%. Yo-yo loading\, not absolute load\, is what precedes injury. This d
 ip is planned and the rebound is controlled.\n55 days to Ultra X Madeira
  25K.
