DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20260919
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20260920
SUMMARY:▲ LONG DAY 2:35\, 900 m vert (17 km)
DESCRIPTION:LONG DAY 2:35\, 900 m vert - Posbank if possible\, descents o
 n hard surface DESCENT CUE: shorten the step\, 185-195 spm. Understridin
 g cut strength loss to -8.8% vs -15.5% at preferred step length - roughl
 y halved. Do NOT coach foot strike: the more anterior the strike\, the L
 ARGER the quad torque loss. Let the terrain dictate it.\n\nWeek 11 of 17
  - Build\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTERRAIN WEEKEN
 D #1 of 2 - Posbank/Veluwezoom\, ~1h15 by car\, ~EUR 30 of petrol. Hard-
 surface descents\, 90-110 m climbs. Twenty reps is 1\,800 m of real asce
 nt AND descent. One day there beats ten stairwell sessions\, because san
 d is compliant and actually REDUCES muscle damage relative to firm groun
 d. Madeira is rock and stone steps.\n43 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
