DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261001
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261002
SUMMARY:▲ VERTICAL 45 min
DESCRIPTION:VERTICAL 45 min - STAIRWELL\, your own building or a car park
 . ~12 x 15 floors\, about 540 m. Lift up\, WALK DOWN - the descent is th
 e point. Dutch stair pitch is 30-33 deg\, inside the optimal climbing ra
 nge\, and Madeira is full of stone staircases. Zero travel\, weather-pro
 of.\n\nWeek 13 of 17 - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.\n
 Cutback before the two biggest weeks. Eat. At 56 kg with ~50 kg FFM you 
 need at least 2\,250 kcal before exercise is counted - peak-week days ru
 n 4\,800-5\,000 kcal. Under-fuelling an 11-week ramp is the most likely 
 route to a stress fracture\, and your body mass must not trend down.\n31
  days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
