SUMMARY:DOWN WEEK (7 km)
DESCRIPTION:DOWN WEEK - THRESHOLD 3 x 5 min\, 90 s jog. Volume down\, int
 ensity held. Do not use a down week to prove something.\n\nWeek 13 of 17
  - Build\nDOWN WEEK - recover\, do not add volume.\nKeep HR under 158. W
 alk the climbs. Talk test.\nCutback before the two biggest weeks. Eat. A
 t 56 kg with ~50 kg FFM you need at least 2\,250 kcal before exercise is
  counted - peak-week days run 4\,800-5\,000 kcal. Under-fuelling an 11-w
 eek ramp is the most likely route to a stress fracture\, and your body m
 ass must not trend down.\n34 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
