 2 - POSBANK AGAIN\, not the Ardennes. Roughly EUR 30 of petrol against E
 UR 200\, and twenty reps of a 90-110 m climb is 1\,800 m of ascent AND h
 ard-surface descent - close to the whole race. Sustained descending on f
 irm ground is the one thing stairs cannot replicate\, and it is what dec
 ides your day. POLES: bought 18-20 Sep\, so you have had three weeks on 
 them by now. Use them the whole session. They cut RPE 14-18% and measura
 bly reduce muscle damage over a climb-and-descent day - but an inexperie
 nced pole user in a field study actually got SLOWER\, so the practice is
