SUMMARY:○ OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min
DESCRIPTION:OPTIONAL easy spin 45-60 min - Sunday is now a REST day by de
 fault. Take the ride only if you feel good and Monday's run is easy. Wit
 h a quality session on Monday you need this rest more than you need the 
 ride.\n\nWeek 15 of 17 - Peak\nPEAK WEEKEND - Sat 17 Oct\, 15 days out. 
 This is the overload the taper is built on\; the evidence favours peakin
 g 14-15 days out\, not five weeks. 3:45-4:00 and 1\,600-1\,800 m: roughl
 y 60-70% of race duration but 80-90% of race vertical. Vertical specific
 ity is the lever\, not duration.\n21 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
