SUMMARY:Easy run 7 km
DESCRIPTION:Easy run 7 km (talk test) + 6-8 x 20 s strides after (relaxed
 \, full recovery\, not a workout)\n\nWeek 15 of 17 - Peak\nKeep HR under
  158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nPEAK WEEKEND - Sat 17 Oct\, 15 days o
 ut. This is the overload the taper is built on\; the evidence favours pe
 aking 14-15 days out\, not five weeks. 3:45-4:00 and 1\,600-1\,800 m: ro
 ughly 60-70% of race duration but 80-90% of race vertical. Vertical spec
 ificity is the lever\, not duration.\n18 days to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
