UID:ultraxmadeira25k-w16-s5-easy@garmin-training
DTSTAMP:20260818T215856Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261019
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261020
SUMMARY:TAPER (6 km)
DESCRIPTION:TAPER - 3 x 4 min at threshold\, 90 s jog\, then 4 x 20 s str
 ides. Keeps the legs awake\, costs nothing. Do not add reps because you 
 feel fresh - that is what the taper is supposed to make you feel.\n\nWee
 k 16 of 17 - Taper\nKeep HR under 158. Walk the climbs. Talk test.\nTape
 r starts. Volume down 45-55%\, intensity and frequency UNCHANGED - that 
 combination is worth 2-3%\, about 7-11 minutes on a 6-hour race. NOTHING
  ECCENTRIC AFTER 21 OCTOBER. Last heavy lower-body work is done.\n13 day
 s to Ultra X Madeira 25K.
