SUMMARY:○ Long ride 60 km steady\, HR ~140 (150 min)
DESCRIPTION:Long ride 60 km steady\, HR ~140\n\nWeek 1 of 12 - Base\nADMI
 N FIRST: (1) book the certificato medico agonistico - Italy legally requ
 ires an ECG-based sports medical on the FITRI form\, and without it you 
 are not issued a race pack. Schedule by February. (2) Pull your best 20-
 min power from Garmin/Strava history\, x0.95 = FTP. Every bike split bel
 ow is a guess until you do. Swim goes to FOUR short sessions - frequency
  beats volume\, fatigue compromises motor learning. SESSION COUNT: 3 run
 s\, 3-4 swims\, 2 bikes\, 1 legs\, 6 days with Thursday off. That is ~9-
 10 h/week\, which is INTERMEDIATE volume - MyProCoach's beginner 70.3 pl
 an averages 7 h. If adherence slips\, scale to the beginner shape rather
  than abandoning weeks. CUT ORDER: (1) Monday easy run\, (2) the fourth 
 swim\, (3) Wednesday legs. Never cut the long ride\, the long run\, or b
 elow three swims.\n83 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
