  3:41/100 m and ANY STROKE IS LEGAL - breaststroke the whole thing is pe
 rmitted\, and you may hold a buoy or kayak to rest provided you make no 
 forward progress. Knowing that is what stops the panic that actually cau
 ses swim DNFs.\n40 days to IRONMAN 70.3 Venice-Jesolo.
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
