  will start ~08:15-08:30. Enter at the EDGE of your box. Water 15-17 C. 
 Warm up in the water 06:30-07:00 then stay warm for 90 min. Swim the fir
 st 200 m deliberately too slowly. CUT-OFFS: swim 1:10 (absolute - zero f
 inishers in 19\,137 splits swam over 70:00)\, bike 5:30\, overall 8:30. 
 TRANSITION IS ~1 KM FROM THE SWIM START - two venues\, walk it Friday. T
 arget 6:15-7:15. Venice is a fast race: M25-29 median is 5:12\, so you w
 ill be near the back of a quick field. That is fine.\n5 days to IRONMAN 
